{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sendBadges:"}],"symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"sendBadges:"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Method","title":"sendBadges:","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)sendBadges:"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sendbadges:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Synchronizes the application badge number with Pushwoosh servers.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/sendBadges:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSInteger","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSInteger"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"badge","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"badge","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current application badge number (0 to clear badge)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports the current badge count to Pushwoosh for analytics and to enable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"badge-based segmentation. This is useful for:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Analytics","type":"text"}]},{"text":": Track user engagement through unread counts","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Segmentation","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Target users with high\/low badge counts"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Badge management"}]},{"text":": Allow server-side badge manipulation","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call this method whenever you update the app badge to keep Pushwoosh in sync.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Sync badge with Pushwoosh when updating unread counts:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class NotificationBadgeManager {","","    private(set) var unreadCount: Int = 0 {","        didSet {","            updateBadge()","        }","    }","","    func markAsRead(_ notificationIds: [String]) {","        unreadCount = max(0, unreadCount - notificationIds.count)","    }","","    func handleNewNotification() {","        unreadCount += 1","    }","","    func clearAll() {","        unreadCount = 0","    }","","    private func updateBadge() {","        \/\/ Update system badge","        if #available(iOS 16.0, *) {","            UNUserNotificationCenter.current().setBadgeCount(unreadCount)","        } else {","            UIApplication.shared.applicationIconBadgeNumber = unreadCount","        }","","        \/\/ Sync with Pushwoosh","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(unreadCount)","    }","}","","\/\/ Usage in AppDelegate","class AppDelegate: UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func applicationDidBecomeActive(_ application: UIApplication) {","        \/\/ Sync current badge state when app becomes active","        let currentBadge = application.applicationIconBadgeNumber","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(currentBadge)","    }","}"]}]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","title":"PushwooshCore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"title":"PWConfiguration","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/sendBadges:":{"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sendBadges:"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Synchronizes the application badge number with Pushwoosh servers."}],"type":"topic","title":"sendBadges:","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/sendBadges:","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"sendBadges:"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sendbadges:"}}}